<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Bryan taunt b4 into jet Upper</Major>
    <Description>As all of us tekken fans know, taunt into anything is very very hard and also very very rewarding, this macro allows you to pull of one of the hardest taunt moves in the game! Just set it to &lt;&lt;while holding&gt;&gt; and make sure to download keyran for more free macros! Also make sure to set your keybinds to default.</Description>
